  "name": "Potato Blinis with Brown Butter and Smoked Trout",
  "subtitle": "Crisp potato cakes with trout and soured cream",
  "description": "Tender baked-potato blinis are flavored with brown butter and herbs, then served with soured cream, smoked trout, and optional dill.",
